    <string name="term_help">"GitGo built-in console (JGit). Works inside the repositories folder.\nFiles:  ls, cd, pwd, cat, mkdir, touch, rm [-r], echo, clear\nGit:    git init | clone &lt;url&gt; [folder] | status | add [path|.] | commit -m \"text\" [-a]\n        git push | pull | fetch | log [-N] | diff | branch [name|-d name]\n        git checkout [-b] &lt;branch&gt; | merge &lt;branch&gt; | reset [--hard] [ref]\n        git remote [-v|add|remove] | tag [name] | stash [pop] | rm &lt;path&gt;\n        git config user.name|user.email [value]\nGitGo:  git send \"message\" — fast send (commit + parallel upload through the GitHub API)"</string>
